Run this command in your terminal in the directory OpenShot was downloaded to verify the SHA256 checksum:
  echo "bfad1a866265f05024ffee90e5a770d4e584424f2ee6952812c55fcd2133177a  OpenShot-v4.0.0-x86_64.dmg" | shasum -a 256 --check

You should get the following output:
  OpenShot-v4.0.0-x86_64.dmg: OK